{"step_index":2438,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-27T12:21:29Z","thinking":"Focusing on the user's UI requirements, the initial design will center on a rounded card with modern borders and soft shadows. The header will feature the Spectra logo on the left and minimize/expand and move buttons on the right. Further UI elements will be detailed as the specification unfolds.\n\n\nThe settings menu design incorporates user information, update functionality, and theming options with a default \"light\" theme that mimics the existing white theme, complete with a dark mode toggle. The main dashboard displays session cards with date, title, subtitle, badges, status, and a \"view transcript\" button, along with a search bar and a \"create session\" button. The primary dashboard design now calls for a search bar and sort icon.\n\n\nThe \"Create Interview Session\" modal structure is now clear. Details entry includes session type selection, company name, job description, and context upload options for CV/resumes and documents. \"Next\" button leads to the preferences step.\n\nPreferences include AI provider, model, interview mode selection, and audio test before session start. The \"Start Session\" action initiates the live interview view with transcript bubbles in the application's theme.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"/* ==========================================================================\\n   SPECTRA — PARAKEET AI INSPIRED THEME & LAYOUT (1:1 FIDELITY)\\n   Supports Light Mode (Default) and Dark Mode via [data-theme=\\\"dark\\\"]\\n   ========================================================================== */\\n\\n:root {\\n    /* --- Light Mode (Default) --- */\\n    --card-bg: #ffffff;\\n    --card-border: #e4e4e7;\\n    --card-shadow: 0 10px 30px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08), 0 0 1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\\n    \\n    --text-main: #09090b;\\n    --text-muted: #71717a;\\n    --text-sub: #a1a1aa;\\n    \\n    --bg-page: transparent;\\n    --bg-input: #ffffff;\\n    --border-input: #e4e4e7;\\n    --border-input-focus: #18181b;\\n    \\n    --badge-bg: #f4f4f5;\\n    --badge-text: #27272a;\\n    --badge-border: #e4e4e7;\\n    \\n    --brand-green: #16a34a;\\n    --brand-green-hover: #15803d;\\n    --brand-green-subtle: #dcfce7;\\n    \\n    --button-primary-bg: #18181b;\\n    --button-primary-text: #fafafa;\\n    --button-primary-hover: #27272a;\\n\\n    --button-secondary-bg: #ffffff;\\n    --button-secondary-text: #18181b;\\n    --button-secondary-border: #e4e4e7;\\n    --button-secondary-hover: #f4f4f5;\\n\\n    --menu-bg: #ffffff;\\n    --menu-border: #e4e4e7;\\n    --menu-hover: #f4f4f5;\\n    \\n    --stepper-active: #16a34a;\\n    --stepper-inactive: #e4e4e7;\\n    \\n    --icon-muted: #71717a;\\n    --icon-hover: #18181b;\\n\\n    --font-sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\\n    --radius-window: 24px;\\n    --radius-card: 16px;\\n    --radius-btn: 12px;\\n    --radius-pill: 9999px;\\n}\\n\\n[data-theme=\\\"dark\\\"] {\\n    --card-bg: #121316;\\n    --card-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);\\n    --card-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\\n    \\n    --text-main: #f4f4f5;\\n    --text-muted: #a1a1aa;\\n    --text-sub: #71717a;\\n    \\n    --bg-page: transparent;\\n    --bg-input: #18191e;\\n    --border-input: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\\n    --border-input-focus: #ffffff;\\n\n<truncated 22318 bytes>","Description":"\"Create modern 1:1 Parakeet AI stylesheet supporting Light and Dark modes\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"c:\\\\Users\\\\Arthur Henrique\\\\Documents\\\\GitHub\\\\Spectra\\\\web\\\\css\\\\parakeet-theme.css\"","toolAction":"\"Writing web/css/parakeet-theme.css\"","toolSummary":"\"Create Parakeet theme stylesheet\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
